stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Open

    Open: OPEN - entries accrue for the period
    Closed: CLOSED - date of last entry fixed, renders frozen
    Eligible: ELIGIBLE - the latest rule-set clock has run
    TransferRequired: TRANSFER REQUIRED - leave register only, OSH r.76 sub-rule 2
    Held: HELD - inquiry, dispute or reopened assessment
    Destroyed: DESTROYED - a destruction record is kept

    Open --> Closed: L2 period ends and every source run is locked
    Closed --> Closed: L3 amendment appended, may restart the clock
    Closed --> Eligible: L4 clock expires on the later reading
    Eligible --> TransferRequired: L5 destruction asked for FORM-XX
    TransferRequired --> Eligible: L6 transfer to a new register recorded
    Eligible --> Destroyed: L7 no hold and every longer floor has run
    Closed --> Held: L8 hold placed
    Eligible --> Held: L8 hold placed
    Held --> Closed: L9 hold released and the clock re-evaluated
    Destroyed --> [*]

    note right of Closed
        Wages r.51 sub-rule 4 - five years after the last entry
        OSH and SS - five calendar years from the last entry
        until counsel reads the divergence, the later date applies
    end note
